+- Entities: `entities` + `entity_memberships` data model (unique slug, one-owner-per-entity via `owner_seq`), `UserRole` enum, factories, `Entity`/`EntityMembership` policies, tenant session (`current_entity` middleware), onboarding (`/onboarding`), entity switcher (`/e/switcher`), entity dashboard (`/e/{entity}`) and `POST /e/{entity}/pick`, with `pt_BR`/`en` screen text.
